## Scientific results

The contents of `witness/` are **data, not software**. They are released into
the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal ([witness/LICENSE](witness/LICENSE)).

A Hamiltonian cycle of a power-sum graph is a mathematical fact. Placing the
witnesses under CC0 ensures that anyone may reproduce, cite, redistribute or
build on them without attribution requirements or licence compatibility
concerns.
